  "description_original": "Discover modern comfort in Bar's sought-after Šušanj neighborhood! We are delighted to present a pristine new construction kuća for izdavanje, an exceptional opportunity for contemporary living.\nThis thoughtfully designed residence offers 65.0 m² of bright and airy living space, perfectly crafted for convenience and style. It features one spacious bedroom and one elegant bathroom, both finished to a high standard, making it ideal for singles or couples seeking a sophisticated home.\nAs a new build, you'll benefit from top-quality materials and modern amenities throughout, ensuring a fresh and inviting atmosphere. Enjoy the ease of ready-to-move-in perfection in a vibrant coastal setting.\nNestled in Šušanj, the property boasts excellent connectivity, offering quick access to beautiful local beaches, charming cafes, and essential services. Bar's bustling city center is just a short drive away. Convenient public parking is available, enhancing daily living.\nExperience the best of Montenegrin coastal life in this exquisite new home. Inquire today to arrange your private viewing!",
